    "location": "html-block:74",
    "text": "Overview",
    "heading": "MiCOM P14x"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:75",
    "text": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:76",
    "text": "MiCOM P14x Feeder Management protection relays are especially suitable where a complete or advanced scheme solution is required. They include advanced communication and integrated functions for feeders. They also offer function keys for integral scheme control functionality.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:77",
    "text": "The following models are available:",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:78",
    "text": "P141 – Feeder management relay",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:79",
    "text": "P142 – Feeder management with integrated Autoreclose",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:80",
    "text": "P143 – Feeder management, integrated Autoreclose and Check Synchronism",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:81",
    "text": "P144 – Feeder management, integrated Autoreclose and Residual Voltage input",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:82",
    "text": "P145 – Feeder management, Autoreclose, Check Synchronism and Enhanced operator control functions",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:83",
    "text": "Housed in standard MiCOM 40TE, 60TE or 80TE, 4U case sizes, P14x offers a complete and scalable range of feeder protection, serial and Ethernet communications, including IEC61850 and a multi-language HMI featuring English, French, German, Spanish, Russian and Chinese.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:84",
    "text": "Contractual warranty",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:85",
    "text": "Period : 2 years",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:86",
    "text": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:87",
    "text": "Advanced Feeder Management",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:88",
    "text": "Extensive functionality to meet all feeder applications",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:89",
    "text": "Programmable Scheme Logic to allow easy customization",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:90",
    "text": "Comprehensive communication options including IEC 61850 and redundant Ethernet ports",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:91",
    "text": "Applications"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:92",
    "text": "MiCOM P14x feeder management relay provides an integrated solution for the complete protection, control and monitoring of overhead lines and underground cables from distribution to transmission voltage levels",
    "heading": "Applications"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:93",
    "text": "MiCOM P14x range is a suite for all applications where overcurrent protection is required. It is suitable for solidly earthed, impedance earthed, Petersen coil earthed and isolated systems.",
    "heading": "Applications"
  },
